{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05292","headline":"奉和幸安乐公主山庄应制 · 李迥秀","name":"奉和幸安乐公主山庄应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"诘旦重门闻警跸，传言太主奏山林。\n是日回舆罗万骑，此时欢喜赐千金。\n鹭羽凤箫参乐曲，荻园竹径接帷阴。\n手舞足蹈方无已，万年千岁奉薰琴。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李迥秀","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05292.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05292","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}